{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.1 Load packages",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Quiet[Remove[\"DCTDataImport`*\", \"NNLSFit`*\", \"DCTKernel`*\", \"DCT`*\",\r\n             \"DCTPlots`*\", \"DCTPeakAnalysis`*\", \"DCTSensitivity`*\",\r\n             \"DCTBiophysics`*\", \"DCTAdmittanceStats`*\", \"DCTKKCheck`*\"]];\r\n$ContextPath = Select[$ContextPath, !StringMatchQ[#, \"DCT*\" | \"NNLSFit*\"] &];\r\nGet[\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\DCT.wl\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq928dc5-vwlt4hd\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHRjb2xvcnsjMDBmZjAwfXtcdGV4dHvinJQgRENUIHBhY2thZ2UgbG9hZGVkLn19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">✔ DCT package loaded.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "60b6061a-4589-4248-9c47-6d395268a145"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.2 Parameters",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ── PARAMETERS ── edit these, then re-run this cell ── *)\r\n\r\n(* Data directories *)\r\ndataDir          = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\drift_03252026\";  (* drift data — E1/E2/E3 subdirs *)\r\nconcentrationDir = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\spike\";           (* spike titration in PBS *)\r\n\r\n(* Debugging — use only every Nth file to run faster; set to 1 for the full dataset *)\r\ndebugDecimationFactor = 1;\r\n\r\n(* Fit parameters — tuned on drift data in Sections 1–3, locked here for all fits.\r\n   fMinHz is set automatically by Section 1.3 from the Lin-KK population analysis. *)\r\nlambdaND      = 1*^-3;  (* Tikhonov regularisation — from L-curve analysis *)\r\nfMaxHz        = 1000.;  (* upper frequency cutoff [Hz] *)\r\nweightPower   = -1.0;  (* admittance weight exponent *)\r\nbinsPerDecade = 15;     (* tau grid density *)\r\ntauMinFactor  = 0.1;    (* tau grid lower extension factor *)\r\ntauMaxFactor  = 10.;    (* tau grid upper extension factor *)\r\n\r\n(* Natural sort: group by electrode subdir, then by numeric file number.\r\n   Plain Sort gives lexicographic order (118 before 15) which breaks time ordering. *)\r\nsortFiles[files_List] := SortBy[files,\r\n  {FileNameTake[#, {-2}],\r\n   Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#], NumberString], 0]} &\r\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Method Validation (synthetic recovery)\n\nA known 3-peak g(k) distribution is forward-modelled to an EIS spectrum (SimulateEIS) over a wide synthetic frequency comb, then re-inverted with the same solver used on the real data (DCTSpectrumData). The top panel overlays **recovered** vs **simulated** g(k) — they should coincide (recovered slightly smoothed by Tikhonov regularisation), confirming the inversion recovers a known input. The lower panels show the simulated Bode magnitude and phase.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Known 3-peak g(k) (equal heights) -> forward EIS -> re-invert -> overlay.\n   Uses the same fit parameters as the real-data analysis. *)\n\n(* \"True\" distribution: three EQUAL Gaussian peaks (in log k) at k = 10, 100, 1000 /s *)\nsimTau  = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 1./binsPerDecade];   (* tau grid; k = 1/tau *)\nsimK    = 1. / simTau;\npeakKs  = {10., 100., 1000.};   peakSig = 0.15;   peakAmp = 1.*^-7;\ngSim    = peakAmp * Total[Exp[-((Log10[simK] - Log10[#])^2) / (2 peakSig^2)] & /@ peakKs];\nsimRs   = 50.;   simC0 = 1.*^-7;\n\n(* Forward model -> EIS over a wide synthetic frequency comb (noise-free) *)\nsimFreq = 10.^Range[-1., 5., 0.1];\nsimZ    = DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[gSim, simTau, simRs, simC0, simFreq];\n\n(* Re-invert with the same solver/params used on the real data *)\nsimRec  = DCT`DCTSpectrumData[simFreq, simZ,\n   \"FMinUse\" -> Min[simFreq], \"FMaxUse\" -> Max[simFreq],\n   \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade, \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower,\n   \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotCombValidation[simK, gSim, simRec]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"97\" data-out-n=\"573\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[573]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_14903bpqmc8lb.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_14903bpqmc8lb.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Known 3-peak g(k) (equal heights) -> forward EIS -> re-invert -> overlay.\n   Uses the same fit parameters as the real-data analysis. *)\n\n(* \"True\" distribution: three EQUAL Gaussian peaks (in log k) at k = 10, 100, 1000 /s *)\nsimTau  = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 1./binsPerDecade];   (* tau grid; k = 1/tau *)\nsimK    = 1. / simTau;\npeakKs  = {10., 100., 1000.};   peakSig = 0.15;   peakAmp = 1.*^-7;\ngSim    = peakAmp * Total[Exp[-((Log10[simK] - Log10[#])^2) / (2 peakSig^2)] & /@ peakKs];\nsimRs   = 50.;   simC0 = 1.*^-7;\n\n(* Forward model -> EIS over a wide synthetic frequency comb (noise-free) *)\nsimFreq = 10.^Range[-1., 5., 0.1];\nsimZ    = DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[gSim, simTau, simRs, simC0, simFreq];\n\n(* Re-invert with the same solver/params used on the real data *)\nsimRec  = DCT`DCTSpectrumData[simFreq, simZ,\n   \"FMinUse\" -> Min[simFreq], \"FMaxUse\" -> Max[simFreq],\n   \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade, \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower,\n   \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotCombValidation[simK, gSim, simRec]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "5a23c26c-10cd-4546-b4c4-76f46c34f30b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Simulated vs extracted parameters + % error.\n   Peak area = trapezoid of g over log10 k; central k = arg max,\n   in windows split at the valleys 10^1.5, 10^2.5. *)\nkEdges = {0., 10.^1.5, 10.^2.5, Infinity};\nwindowStat[kv_, gv_, lo_, hi_] := Module[{o, ks, gs, sel},\n  o = Ordering[kv];  ks = kv[[o]];  gs = gv[[o]];\n  sel = (lo <= # < hi &) /@ ks;  ks = Pick[ks, sel];  gs = Pick[gs, sel];\n  {ks[[First @ Ordering[gs, -1]]],\n   If[Length[gs] < 2, 0., Total[(Most[gs] + Rest[gs]) / 2 * Abs[Differences[Log10[ks]]]]]}\n];\nsimStats = Table[windowStat[simK, gSim, kEdges[[i]], kEdges[[i + 1]]], {i, 3}];\nextStats = Table[windowStat[1./simRec[\"Tau\"], simRec[\"g\"], kEdges[[i]], kEdges[[i + 1]]], {i, 3}];\n\nrows = {\n  {\"Rs (Ohm)\",         simRs,                  simRec[\"Rs\"]},\n  {\"Cd = C0 (nF)\",     simC0 1.*^9,            simRec[\"C0\"] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 1 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[1, 1]],       extStats[[1, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 2 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[2, 1]],       extStats[[2, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 3 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[3, 1]],       extStats[[3, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 1 area (nF)\", simStats[[1, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[1, 2]] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 2 area (nF)\", simStats[[2, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[2, 2]] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 3 area (nF)\", simStats[[3, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[3, 2]] 1.*^9}\n};\n\n(* 4th column = signed percent error: 100 (extracted - simulated) / simulated.\n   Assigned to validationTable so Section 6 can export it. *)\nvalidationTable = Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    (Append[#, 100. (#[[3]] - #[[2]]) / #[[2]]] & /@ rows) /. x_?NumericQ :> NumberForm[N[x], {6, 2}],\n    Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"Quantity\", \"Simulated\", \"Extracted\", \"% error\"}\n  ],\n  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Right, Right}},\n  Dividers  -> {None, {2 -> True}},\n  Spacings  -> {3, 0.6},\n  BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 13}\n];\nvalidationTable",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"95\" data-out-n=\"555\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[555]= </span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq98sjvu-9wh5kol\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.8em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quantity</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rs (Ohm)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cd = C0 (nF)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 1 k (1/s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 2 k (1/s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 3 k (1/s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 1 area (nF)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 2 area (nF)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.79em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak 3 area (nF)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Simulated</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">50.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">100.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">100.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1000.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.57</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.53</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.79em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.57</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Extracted</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">50.01</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">100.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">9.96</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">99.58</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">995.82</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.82</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.85</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.79em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">37.38</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">% error</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-0.42</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-0.42</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-0.42</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.67</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.79em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-0.49</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
