     "id": "3e0343be-3e38-480f-878f-cbf02356d187"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.3 Set fMaxHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Above ~500 Hz the variance-vs-mean curve inflects away from the power law:\n   admittance is dominated by Rs / parasitic capacitance, not charge transfer.\n   DCT resolves nothing useful there — tighten the upper cutoff. *)\nfMaxHz = 500.;\nPrint[\"fMaxHz \\[LeftArrow] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMaxHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq928xxe-kac6a9m\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMaxHz ←[formula] Hz",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4bfe8ebd-34a3-4196-99be-ebd612513960"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.4 Variance overview",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"61\" data-out-n=\"360\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[360]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1xlcsdhf1q3l5.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1xlcsdhf1q3l5.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "99489b68-d6b7-481a-8d69-d2bdb13ff8a1"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.5 Parameter readout",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fMinHz\r\nfMaxHz",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"361\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[361]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq928yjz-qmsm1k2\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
